><sprite=0><indent=16>触发效果：\\r\\n<indent=16><sprite=3><indent=32>自身受到技能伤害后<color=#64F9FA>恢复</color>自身最大体力的1/3\\r\\n<indent=32><sprite=4><indent=48>然后若自身体力低于对手则下回合100%<color=#64F9FA>闪避</color>对手的<b>攻击技能</b>\\r\\n\\r\\n<indent=0><sprite=0><indent=16>战阶结束效果：\\r\\n<indent=16><sprite=3><indent=32>战斗阶段结束时，若自身未受到技能伤害则下回合<b>攻击技能</b>必定<color=#64F9FA>打出致命一击</color>\",\n      \"analyze_desc\": \"\",\n      \"pve_effective\": false,\n      \"intensified\": false,\n      \"is_adv\": false,\n      \"pet\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": 4472,\n          \"url\": \"https://api.seerapi.com/v1/pet/4472\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"effect\": {\n        \"effect_args\": [\n          3,\n          100,\n          1\n        ],\n        \"effect\": {\n          \"id\": 2070,\n          \"url\": \"https://api.seerapi.com/v1/eid_effect/2070\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"effect_alias\": \"alias_2070_3_100_1\",\n      \"tag\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": 6,\n          \"url\": \"https://api.seerapi.com/v1/soulmark_tag/6\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": 18,\n          \"url\": \"https://api.seerapi.com/v1/soulmark_tag/18\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": 2,\n          \"url\": \"https://api.seerapi.com/v1/soulmark_tag/2\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"intensified_to\": null,\n      \"from\": null,\n      \"advance\": null,\n      \"hash\": \"6267b18b\"\n    },\n    \"loadedAt\": \"2026-10-22T05:42:07.539Z\",\n    \"storage\": \"refreshed\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n4472补充验证：4472-supplement-v4.log18/18退出0，包含648控制未用/属性使用不消费、1126有限PP池不重复抽；与87重叠不累加。无新增用户回答。\n\n",
